OL,3,ADelhi braces for more protests as
OL,4,A'cockroach' group's leaders released
OL,5,
OL,6,FA court in the Indian capital has
OL,7,Fordered the release of top leaders of
OL,8,Fthe Gen Z-led Cockroach Janta Party
OL,9,F(CJP) even as the city braces for
OL,10,Fprotests for a second day with
OL,11,Fthousands of security personnel
OL,12,Fdeployed and roads barricaded.
OL,14,FAbhijeet Dipke - who began the movement
OL,15,Fin May after India's Chief Justice
OL,16,Flikened some jobless young people to
OL,17,F"cockroaches" - and other leaders had
OL,18,Fbeen detained on arrival in Delhi on
OL,19,FSaturday to lead protests seeking
OL,20,Felectoral reforms.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
